      "writtenOn": "2022-12-20T06:15:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`fdt_overlay_apply` always breaks overlay, because it overwrites properties after fixups. For an example, [overlay_fixup_one_phandle](https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/dtc/+/refs/heads/master/libfdt/fdt_overlay.c#353) modifies prop with phandle values.\n\nDue to the reason, [fdt_overlay_apply()](https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/dtc/+/refs/heads/master/libfdt/fdt_overlay.c#850) always invalidates overlay\u0027s fdt magic, to prevent further uses. `fdtoverlay.c` keeps the copy for preventing data corruption. should we repeat the pattern?\n\n\nnit: `libufdt` seems to have the same problem (tested manually with local changes)",
      "parentUuid": "01716d68_63f48453",
      "revId": "bc94b73e10b43bb9e33cfab5d0da211f18509151",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
