      "writtenOn": "2022-12-20T10:15:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I guess `apply_debug_policy` should also be unsafe for the same reason as `apply_overlay`\n\nDone\n\n\u003e should we repeat the pattern?\n\nThe DP DTBO should only be applied once: if it fails, we reboot, and if it succeeds, we boot the kernel. So keeping a copy isn\u0027t necessary, IMO. In terms of Rust API, it would be nice for the `apply_*` functions to consume the overlay, but that\u0027s not possible with `\u0026[u8]`, AFAIK.",
      "parentUuid": "6350bd9f_65f4c5cb",
